lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua is an environmentalist, he firmly believes that it is necessary to reduce the pollution of the city, especially plastic waste. He often organizes cleaning activities by the river and works hard to promote environmental awareness. On the other hand, Zhang Wei is a successful plastic product sales manager, his performance mainly depends on the mass production and sale of disposable plastic products. Zhang Wei recently receives an important sales award, he decides to invite Li Hua to celebrate.\n\n[Question]\nWhat kind of celebration method does Zhang Wei choose?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Invite Li Hua to a luxury cruise party\nB. Celebrate at an outdoor barbecue party\nC. Invite him to visit the company and show his own performance\nD. Celebrate in a green-themed restaurant","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725463806190015,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af582d99aa9dc5a833d267c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794474713456,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:11:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5fd29202b91648b59e3d2b1735a03806"}